WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.560
This video gives a brief introduction to the Arclight device.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Switch it on using this grey button.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
At first, both ends of the Arclight may come on at the same time.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
If it does not come on at all or the lights are dim, the battery may be flat.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
Plug it in using the USB charger.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
When charging, the green lights will come on.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
After 15 minutes, it should be fully charged and work for several hours.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Leaving it in sunlight will keep the battery charged.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
You will not need to replace any batteries or bulbs.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
The mode when both ends come on is for general use.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Switch to eye mode by holding the button down for 15 seconds.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Then lift your fingers and quickly press again as the light flashes.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
You are now in eye mode, where the ophthalmoscope will come on

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
first, then the anterior segment loupe.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Repeating these steps will cycle through three different modes of use.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
General use, eyes, then ears.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Once you have selected the preferred mode, pressing the grey button

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
changes how bright the lights are and which end is lit.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Make sure you use the correct end for the correct examination.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
The external eye is examined by using the loupe.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
The view will be clear when you are very close to the eye at around 6 cm.

22
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.300
The fundal reflex is performed at arm's length using the direct ophthalmoscope.

23
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.740
If the view is blurred, then check the lens rack is at the top.

24
00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:00.540
In this position, there is no lens in the sight hole and the reflex should be clear.
